# V1.0 Avalonia source tree — local only. The whole subtree (code, XAML,
# project file, build artifacts) stays out of the public repo. Only
# release artifacts (the published EXE) are tracked under releases/.
BrightRaider.Avalonia/

# V1.0 single-EXE launcher project (embeds the Avalonia runtime + extracts
# it to %LOCALAPPDATA% on first launch). Source + build artifacts stay
# local-only, same reason as BrightRaider.Avalonia/.
BrightRaider.Launcher/

